        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Species: Strymon bazochii\n- Places: Hawaii\n- Concepts: biological control, species richness\n- Products: Silibinin\n- Taxa: target genus, source genus\n\nFacts:\n- Strymon bazochii was introduced to Hawaii in 1902 for biological control of a genus.\n- The genus targeted by Strymon bazochii in Hawaii has more species than the genus that produces Silibinin.\n- Silibinin is extracted from a genus different from the genus targeted by Strymon bazochii.",
